\name{cellucid_history_branch_delete}
\alias{cellucid_history_branch_delete}
\title{Delete a branch}
\usage{
cellucid_history_branch_delete(viewer, branch, tracker, with_sub_branches = FALSE)
}
\arguments{
\item{viewer}{A viewer \code{\link{cellucid_view}()} or \code{\link{cellucid_serve}()} returned.}
\item{branch}{A branch by its name or its id (history_summary lists them). Text (at least 1 character). Required.}
\item{tracker}{A tracker by its name or its id (history_summary lists them); the tracker in use when left out. Text (at least 1 character). Left out unless given (the viewer then chooses as its own control does).}
\item{with_sub_branches}{Also delete every branch that starts from it. \code{TRUE} or \code{FALSE}. Default \code{FALSE}, the viewer's own.}
}
\value{
A \code{cellucid_action_request}, at once and invisibly: the action is sent now, or when the viewer's channel opens.
\code{\link{cellucid_action_result}(request)} returns its outcome: a list of \code{absorbed_by} (The branch that keeps its shared steps), \code{branches} (The branches deleted), \code{head} (The step shown now), \code{journal} (Its Recently deleted entry), \code{kept_views} (Kept views elsewhere made from it (they keep their picture)), \code{replays} (Trackers replayed from it), \code{results} (Results computed on them), \code{steps} (Steps moved to Recently deleted).
}
\description{
Move a branch's own steps (those no other branch starts from) to Recently deleted, where they can be restored; with with_sub_branches, the branches that start from it too. Main and locked branches cannot be deleted.
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{history.branch.delete} (History). It moves the viewer's history, as the person's Undo, Redo or a click on a step does: it makes no step of the history.

When an agent (Claude, ChatGPT) runs it, the viewer asks the person first (deletes-saved); from R it is not asked.
}
\seealso{
\code{\link{cellucid_act}()} sends any action by its type, and \code{\link{cellucid_action_result}()}
collects its answer.
}
\examples{
if (interactive() && requireNamespace("SeuratObject", quietly = TRUE)) {
  data("pbmc_small", package = "SeuratObject")
  viewer <- cellucid_view(SeuratObject::UpdateSeuratObject(pbmc_small))
  request <- cellucid_history_branch_delete(viewer, branch = "Main")
  print(request)
  # cellucid_action_result(request) waits for its outcome.
  cellucid_stop(viewer)
}
}
